      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: the first line will end up in the top table in the API documentation, then there must be an empty line, and the rest will be in the documentation for the method: https://developer.android.com/reference/android/net/nsd/NsdServiceInfo\n\nThe \"meshcop\" and \"matter\" examples are a bit specific so it may look better if they\u0027re in the description (so after an empty line)",
